<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">On the Complexity Theory of Masked Discrete Diffusion: From <math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{poly}(1/\epsilon)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>poly</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{poly}(1/\epsilon)</annotation></semantics></math> to Nearly <math id="m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>-Free</h1>
