<span id="A1.T2.4.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.4.16.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reverse transition rate at time </span><math id="A1.T2.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.T2.4.16.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> from state </span><math id="A1.T2.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{y}}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{y}}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.T2.4.16.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> to </span><math id="A1.T2.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{y}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.T2.4.16.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="A1.T2.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{t}^{\leftarrow}({\bm{y}},{\bm{y}}^{\prime})\coloneqq R^{\to}({\bm{y}}^{\prime},{\bm{y}})\cdot\frac{q^{\leftarrow}_{t}({\bm{y}})}{q^{\leftarrow}_{t}({\bm{y}}^{\prime})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≔</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">→</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒚</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{t}^{\leftarrow}({\bm{y}},{\bm{y}}^{\prime})\coloneqq R^{\to}({\bm{y}}^{\prime},{\bm{y}})\cdot\frac{q^{\leftarrow}_{t}({\bm{y}})}{q^{\leftarrow}_{t}({\bm{y}}^{\prime})}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.T2.4.16.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, Eq. (</span><a href="#S2.E3" title="In Lemma 2.1 (Adapted from Eqs. (3) and (4) of ( ) ). ‣ The reverse process notations. ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ On the Complexity Theory of Masked Discrete Diffusion: From poly(1/ϵ) to Nearly ϵ-Free" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a><span id="A1.T2.4.16.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></span>
